SUMMARY:Get Down in the Field- Ecstatic Dance Waves w/ Sara Bensman
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, November 8th\n1st Danc
 e Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance 
 Wave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nFacilitat
 or Sara Bensman\n\nIntention: Get Down in the Field\n\nThere’s evidence 
 that before humans could speak\, we made music. Since we have walked the e
 arth\, we have likely danced. We dance together to share community\, to al
 chemically transmute our internal experiences\, to celebrate\, to mourn\, 
 to communicate\, and to simply enjoy the sensation of music moving through
  our bodies. In the sharing of this practice\, we sometimes experience a d
 eep connection to the room of dancers\, even a sense of Oneness in which t
 he tight hold that wraps around our individual ego begins to loosen and we
  feel the entirety of the Collective Field. We marvel at the variation of 
 forms and unique movements that are aspects of the one great orchestration
  of the universe and recognize that I am that and that is me. This dance i
 s an invitation to shift our internal lenses to the widest aperture and fo
 cus our awareness of the Collective Field.\n\n## About Sara Bensman\n\nSar
 a’s mix-making arises from musical exploration. She seeks to understand 
 energy through somatic responses to sonic vibrations. Her facilitation is 
 propelled by a desire to help build and sustain community by creating a sa
 fe\, loving container for self-expression\, connection and release. If you
 ’d like to listen to her sets visit [https://soundcloud.com/sara-bensman
 ](https://soundcloud.com/sara-bensman)\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note th
 at the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle
  and any that come late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a
  safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your 
 price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommen
 ded:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Re
 gister to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/voluntee
 r/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW
 0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIA
 AR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXd
 VB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the beg
 inning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE B
 OTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective
 .org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid
 =IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE
 3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1O
 A_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective
  envisions a world that moves in harmony where all are free to be their au
 thentic selves within a loving community. Our mission and aim are to inspi
 re authenticity and healthy community through free-form dance by hosting d
 ance waves for personal and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) n
 onprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nS
 ee you on the dance floor!
