SUMMARY:All of Me\, Even This - Ecstatic Dance Wave w/ DJ Yaku Beat (Josh 
 Courtney)
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, November 13th\nEvening
  Dance Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\n
 Guest DJ: DJ Yaku Beat (Josh Courtney)\, Support Facilitator: Rory Jagdeo\
 n\nIntention: All of Me\, Even This\n\nThis dance invites the radical cele
 bration of being human. There are parts of ourselves that we repress due t
 o shame\, fear\, and self-judgement. Tonight we embody those archetypes to
  allow them to express themselves fully and unapologetically. Be prepared 
 to dance through a darker journey into the underworld before we come back 
 to the light.\n\n## About DJ Yaku Beat (Josh Courtney)\n\nYaku Beat channe
 ls the spirit of water - flowing\, cleansing and alive. From a life in mod
 ern medicine and entrepreneurship to years on the sacred plant medicine pa
 th\, Josh's evolution has spanned many worlds. Guided by an appetite for s
 elf-revelation\, his beats and live instrumentation will invite you into t
 he depths of your most wild and luminous heart.\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Ple
 ase note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Ope
 ning Circle and any that come late will be turned away. Please be on time 
 to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or
  name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registrati
 on Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance f
 or free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.o
 rg/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=I
 wZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3O
 DgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_
 aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close
  at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENI
 NG CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovemen
 tcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-da
 nce/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lk
 EDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3E
 LhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement
  Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony where all are free to 
 be their authentic selves within a loving community. Our mission and aim a
 re to inspire authenticity and healthy community through free-form dance b
 y hosting dance waves for personal and community transformation. AMC is a 
 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC
  28805\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
