SUMMARY:Ecstatic Dance Wave w/ DJ Karen Funshine @ WWC Bryson Gym
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, November 20th\nEvening
  Dance Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\n
 Guest DJ: Karen Funshine (Karen Smith)\, Support Facilitator TBA\n\nIntent
 ion: TBA\n\n## About DJ Karen Funshine\n\nKaren Funshine (Karen Smith) has
  been dancing since age 3\, with movement as her lifelong ally. A veteran 
 raver & EDM enthusiast\, she was delighted to discover 5Rhythms and ecstat
 ic dance 10 years ago in Austin - a sober and judgment-free space to get w
 ild & free. She’s since facilitated many women’s conscious dance circl
 es and a vibrant live-instrument dance - weaving music and somatic movemen
 t to alchemize emotion\, open the heart\, and awaken joy. Recently relocat
 ed to Asheville\, Karen is honored to share her passion and playfulness wi
 th her beautiful new community through the universal language of music and
  dance.\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up.
  The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and any that come late will be
  turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*
 \\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away fo
 r lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need v
 olunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https
 ://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementco
 llective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10Y
 UN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcb
 Nb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT A
 NNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening circle. P
 lease note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreem
 ents:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevi
 llemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZW
 Q0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAE
 Tf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n
 \nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world that moves i
 n harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves within a loving 
 community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy com
 munity through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal and com
 munity transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocat
